      <h3>Common questions</h3>
      <div class="mini-faq-item fade-up">
        <h4>Can it hold large or heavy blinds?</h4>
        <p>Yes. The tension system is rated for the full weight of the blind plus normal operation. For unusually heavy installs we recommend the permanent bracket system — Our team will advise during the free measurement visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-faq-item fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.05s">
        <h4>Will the blind fall down over time?</h4>
        <p>No. The brackets grip the frame using tensioned pressure points that distribute load evenly. We've fitted them on uPVC, aluminium, wood, and heritage timber frames without a single failure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mini-faq-item fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s">
        <h4>Does it work on all window types?</h4>
        <p>Most modern frames — yes. Unusual profiles (very deep reveals, purely masonry openings, curved bays) may need a hybrid or permanent approach. We confirm compatibility during the free consultation before you commit.</p>
